	(text "  ~7us ON / ~59us OFF (first pulse ~10us) so the P0584ANL flux stays below its 2100 G limit (unipolar: B = 33 x ET)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 707.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "04fbc8c0-e28f-4e17-851f-ad9dcbd75d81")
	)
	(text "LINEAR RAMP (constant-current PNP, reset every zero crossing). RV2: set ramp peak = 4.8V on TP1 RAMP"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 833.12 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "07797ca8-6612-4a29-8040-5c4149c743ed")
	)
	(text "ISOLATED GATE OUTPUTS, CH A (fires when L positive). Schottky bridge makes each output polarity-proof. Each output floats at its SCR cathode"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 471.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "07bae67c-30e0-4f71-b89e-a5fdb934aedd")
	)
	(text "GDT DRIVER B: VGDT -> R41||R51 -> P0584ANL T3 -> Q6.  C33 = local 2u2 at Q6 source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 991.87 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "11d9858f-4362-4092-9c63-15a8e09aa478")
	)
	(text "CONTROL HEADER (3.3V-safe outputs), INDICATORS, TEST POINTS, MOUNTING"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 537.21 471.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "20eedc69-7376-4dbf-b335-ab59af4cd8f4")
	)
	(text "  A1/A2 are driven together (same transformer) - use one per SCR, e.g. paralleled SCRs or the 2 SCRs of a half-controlled bridge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 723.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "21b2bcb8-45ba-4357-96eb-301530181d85")
	)
	(text "  the on-board VGDT supports ~0.4A pulses at ~10% duty. For harder firing inject an external supply (cut JP5 first!)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 730.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "21c22a70-6cc0-4cbd-b6d3-54721a8bb55d")
	)
	(text "GDT DRIVER A: VGDT -> R38||R50 (sets pulse current) -> P0584ANL T2 -> Q5.  D13+D14 reset the core (~16V).  C27 = local 2u2 at Q5 source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 775.97 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2d9563b6-a963-466c-bb14-a7bc830b7c76")
	)
	(text "CONTROL INPUT 0-5V (JP4 fitted: 0-3.3V) -> FIRE_THRESHOLD = 5V - Vin.  0V = OFF (180 deg), 5V = full ON"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "46a8ba1a-d1ad-4cba-a530-05e02024b9d5")
	)
	(text "  D13+D14 (D15+D16, ES1D + BZT52C15) reset the core at ~16V between pulses. C27/C33 close the pulse loop at each MOSFET source.  Q5/Q6 are 100V parts: VGDT + 16V must stay < 80V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 717.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4877a4bd-d08c-48fb-b772-a4042ce3a8eb")
	)
	(text "CALIBRATION: RV2 -> ramp peak 4.8V on TP1 (RAMP).  TP3 (HALF_L_POS) is high while L is positive."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 734.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "49497459-f9a4-4592-90a3-02873c7ff8a2")
	)
	(text "SYNC (winding A, in phase with L) -> HALF_L_POS / HALF_L_NEG + ZERO_CROSS window ZERO_CROSS = NOR(HALF_L_POS, HALF_L_NEG) in U8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 601.98 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "55002a24-0a63-4d6a-8786-d631a5cfed01")
	)
	(text "GATE-DRIVE RAIL: winding B -> LM317HV 23.8V -> JP5 (bridged) -> VGDT.  To inject: CUT JP5, feed J6 (<=48V, scale R38/R41)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 407.67 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "58db1b33-dfed-4944-b15d-c131e73635b6")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS: each gate winding -> TVS -> CDBHM140 Schottky bridge (polarity-proof) -> 2R2 -> G, with 100R / 10nF / 1N4148W at G-K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 720.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "619d80cc-ef09-4f3e-9f53-4de3f1e0706c")
	)
	(text "Timing chain (sync, ramp, FIRE_THRESHOLD = 5V - Vin, FIRE_AND_ENABLE, gated 555, steering) is unchanged from rev A, except the pulse train is shorter:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.5 703.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
