	(text "  Pulse current ~ (VGDT - 4V) / (R38||R50). 24V with 2x120R -> ~0.35A (fits the 2.8VA budget);  48V injected -> 2x220R (~0.4A) ... 2x120R (~0.75A). Keep each 2512 < 1W."
